the other parts of my life...

23:19.231 --> 23:22.542
Listen, Marty. One more time.
It's none of my fucking business.

23:23.102 --> 23:24.274
Fuck.

23:24.370 --> 23:25.576
Look.

23:25.905 --> 23:27.509
We got a job to do.

23:27.840 --> 23:28.841
Off-book.

23:28.908 --> 23:30.581
It's the only play I can think of.

23:30.676 --> 23:34.419
I got to straighten out things
with the family. I gotta fix it.

23:34.513 --> 23:37.119
That bike club. I know 'em.

23:37.249 --> 23:39.456
Had deals with 'em when
I was working narco.

23:39.551 --> 23:42.031
We can get to that motherfucker Ledoux.

23:43.389 --> 23:48.304
So, enough with the self-improvement,
penance, hand-wringing shit.

23:48.560 --> 23:50.904
- Let's go to work.
- You think you're...

23:54.133 --> 23:55.373
Fuck!

23:56.635 --> 23:58.706
Hell of a bedside manner you got, Rust.

23:58.804 --> 24:01.785
You know being stupids
different than calling in sick,

24:01.874 --> 24:04.411
and this is a bar, not a fucking bedside.

24:04.877 --> 24:06.379
A friend in need.

24:08.314 --> 24:11.955
Every time I think you hit a ceiling,
you just keep raising the bar.

24:12.051 --> 24:15.123
You are like the Michael Jordan
of being a son of a bitch.

24:15.220 --> 24:16.221
That's it. Come on.

24:16.288 --> 24:18.996
You're really gonna love this jacket I got.

24:23.796 --> 24:25.241
Holy shit!

24:25.798 --> 24:27.300
You visit a lot of gun shows?

24:28.000 --> 24:31.914
No, it's just some stuff I kept
just in case some work came back on me.

24:35.007 --> 24:37.510
These boys Ledoux deals to,

24:38.444 --> 24:40.424
they're out of East Texas.

24:40.679 --> 24:43.159
I worked 'em when I was DEA task force.

24:46.251 --> 24:47.992
They know you're 5-0?

24:48.253 --> 24:49.357
Nope.

24:49.455 --> 24:52.595
I wasn't sure, so I checked
with my old handler.

24:53.492 --> 24:55.165
As far as my cover goes,

24:55.260 --> 24:59.504
I took three slugs in a DEA shoot-out
at the port of Houston.

25:00.432 --> 25:03.106
Anybody gives a shit, figures I'm dead.

25:04.303 --> 25:09.548
Major said the task force
used to call you Crash.

25:12.344 --> 25:15.018
I'm gonna have to take
some personal time on this, Marty.

25:15.114 --> 25:16.525
A couple of weeks.

25:16.615 --> 25:19.619
Got to get out there and get seen,
drop some lines.

25:20.119 --> 25:22.360
I mean, badges ain't gonna
get us near these people,

25:22.454 --> 25:24.957
so the plan is we make 'em an offer.

25:27.526 --> 25:30.700
Get a line on their supplier.
Confirm it's Ledoux.

25:30.996 --> 25:32.498
Bring him in.

25:34.233 --> 25:37.908
Then once we're out there,
all right, it's just you and me on this.

25:38.303 --> 25:40.806
I don't like that.

25:41.507 --> 25:43.646
What happens if they clock you're not you?

25:45.044 --> 25:46.216
Mmm.

25:47.079 --> 25:50.583
No, I can't do what I need to do
if we got watchdogs.

25:51.250 --> 25:53.662
Besides, like you said, Quesada'd pull me.

25:54.153 --> 25:56.656
The stakes ain't that high anyway.

25:56.722 --> 25:58.861
I get found, I take a bullet to the head.

26:00.225 --> 26:02.569
This cartel I worked on the border,

26:02.661 --> 26:05.608
they had this routine.

26:07.332 --> 26:10.575
They'd duct tape you to a chair
that was bolted to the floor.

26:10.669 --> 26:12.546
Use a couple rolls,

26:12.604 --> 26:14.914
make sure you couldn't
budge a fucking inch.

26:16.575 --> 26:19.181
And then, they'd cut around your face,

26:19.945 --> 26:22.016
grip your scalp, yank down.

26:23.015 --> 26:24.517
Rip your face off.

26:26.351 --> 26:27.352
Hmm.

26:27.419 --> 26:30.628
Then they put a mirror in front of you,

26:31.090 --> 26:33.434
so you can get a good look at yourself.

26:35.394 --> 26:38.068
Then they cut your dick and your balls off,

26:41.533 --> 26:43.911
shove 'em down your throat

26:44.069 --> 26:47.744
until you bled and choked out
while you were watching.

26:53.145 --> 26:55.455
So, as far as high stakes go,

26:55.547 --> 26:57.390
bullet to the head,

26:57.449 --> 26:58.723
it ain't that.

26:59.985 --> 27:01.055
Hey.

27:03.288 --> 27:05.393
You sure you wanna do this?

27:06.391 --> 27:08.462
Not exactly.

27:30.115 --> 27:33.187
You realize you got
a upstairs here, right?

27:44.363 --> 27:45.842
What is that?

27:46.431 --> 27:48.138
Ink and cayenne.

27:49.334 --> 27:51.871
Irritates the skin, looks contused.

27:52.171 --> 27:55.345
How long did they have you out there,
working the corridor?

27:56.842 --> 27:59.152
- Almost four years.
- Four?

28:00.279 --> 28:01.622
What the hell.

28:01.980 --> 28:04.859
UCs ain't supposed
to do more than 11 months.

28:07.186 --> 28:09.530
Yeah, but I had fucked up on the job,

28:09.621 --> 28:12.659
and they could do
whatever they wanted with me.

28:14.626 --> 28:17.038
That's a long time being like that.

28:24.736 --> 28:28.047
I need a good story to move fast,
and I think I got one.

28:30.142 --> 28:32.349
All I need now is some good coke.

28:34.012 --> 28:35.685
Where you gonna get that?

28:37.983 --> 28:39.485
Don't worry about it.

28:42.387 --> 28:45.994
So you got a suspect,
and you take a leave of absence?

28:46.525 --> 28:47.560
Yep.

28:47.659 --> 28:49.502
Like I said, to see my pops.

28:51.330 --> 28:52.673
Had leukemia.

28:59.938 --> 29:01.246
Hey, Favre.

29:01.340 --> 29:03.081
Can I get the evidence key from you?

29:03.175 --> 29:04.347
Yeah.

29:04.409 --> 29:07.447
- Heard you were taking time.
- Yeah, leaving tonight.

29:07.913 --> 29:09.392
- Sign the log.
- Yep.

30:26.258 --> 30:28.602
You supposed to see both eyes in this one?

30:59.124 --> 31:02.128
They really should have
a better system for this.

31:02.627 --> 31:04.587
We looked at
your old partner's history.

31:04.663 --> 31:07.371
And coincidences keep mounting, Detective.

31:08.800 --> 31:10.871
Oh, coincidences. Like what?

31:10.969 --> 31:13.745
Well, I don't know if
it would qualify as coincidence,

31:13.839 --> 31:16.581
but near as we can tell,
his pops never had leukemia.

31:16.675 --> 31:18.052
No hospital records of that.

31:18.143 --> 31:22.091
Fact' nobody in that town in Alaska
seen Travis Cohle in more than 30 years.

31:23.648 --> 31:24.752
That it?

31:25.384 --> 31:27.762
You still angry at him? Your pops?

31:27.853 --> 31:29.025
No.

31:29.755 --> 31:30.995
He's dead.

31:32.357 --> 31:33.358
You were, though?

31:33.825 --> 31:35.532
I mean, why you two didn't talk.

31:36.261 --> 31:38.207
We never really liked each other.

31:38.764 --> 31:40.573
There's a difference.

31:45.036 --> 31:46.572
He was in 'Nam.

31:46.838 --> 31:49.717
Met my mother on leave in Galveston.

31:49.841 --> 31:51.843
The time he came back, I was two.

31:51.910 --> 31:54.948
She dumped me on him, then she hauled ass,

31:55.046 --> 31:56.923
and he and I moved to Alaska.

31:57.182 --> 32:00.561
He was a survivalist, I
guess you'd call it.

32:02.521 --> 32:04.899
Had some pretty fucking strange ideas.

32:09.528 --> 32:12.407
Oh, there's nothing like
the night sky out there, though.

32:14.966 --> 32:16.877
I couldn't handle the cold,

32:18.103 --> 32:19.810
so I headed back to South Texas,

32:19.905 --> 32:23.546
'cause all I could remember was
at least it never got cold.

32:26.445 --> 32:29.983
My old man always made
like I let him down that way.

32:33.084 --> 32:34.961
Said I had no loyalty.

32:38.323 --> 32:41.167
A clean break is best now,
while they're still young.

32:41.259 --> 32:43.671
Look, it's none of my business, okay.

32:43.762 --> 32:46.140
But I do need him to watch my back on this.

32:46.231 --> 32:47.767
This is how you all get warped.

32:48.800 --> 32:51.576
You always shortchange the wrong things.

32:52.270 --> 32:53.578
Shortchange.
- Mmm-hmm.

32:54.172 --> 32:55.310
What else?

32:57.509 --> 33:00.854
He wanted me to pass a tide
of apologies of which I'll skip.

33:03.181 --> 33:06.594
And he wants to see the girls
if you can make time for it.

33:14.125 --> 33:16.696
Kids are the only thing
that matter, Maggie.

33:17.929 --> 33:21.001
They're the only reason for
this whole man-woman drama.

33:21.933 --> 33:23.173
I'm sorry.

33:23.268 --> 33:25.145
What are you suggesting, exactly?

33:25.203 --> 33:27.114
Just that people fuck up.

33:29.174 --> 33:30.380
We age.

33:30.775 --> 33:34.848
Men, women, it's not supposed to work,
except to make kids.

33:36.715 --> 33:38.626
So if you could imagine

33:39.150 --> 33:41.687
Marty's behavior
as an expression of weakness,

33:42.988 --> 33:43.989
Pain'

33:44.055 --> 33:46.501
you'd see that it's not about you.

33:46.625 --> 33:49.333
So, end of the day,
you duck under rationalization.

33:49.394 --> 33:51.169
Same as any of 'em.

33:52.464 --> 33:54.466
You must've been a great husband.

34:30.402 --> 34:33.679
People been seeing me around
for about a week.

34:33.738 --> 34:36.617
Guy I used to run with,
he wants to meet me tonight.

34:37.008 --> 34:40.353
Now, if I can get him alone,
we snatch him up, work him over,

34:40.412 --> 34:41.755
maybe get to Ledoux.

34:43.081 --> 34:45.083
- Okay. Great.
- All right.

34:45.850 --> 34:46.850
Listen...

34:46.885 --> 34:49.525
Phone's fully charged.
And remember, it's real simple.

34:49.588 --> 34:51.966
Green answers. Red hangs up.

34:52.057 --> 34:54.264
- I'm the only one that's gonna be calling.
- All right.

34:54.359 --> 34:55.963
- Keep it charged.
- Yeah.

35:00.398 --> 35:03.538
Listen, how was she? What'd she say?

35:05.770 --> 35:07.215
She was better.

35:07.806 --> 35:09.217
I could see her softening.

35:10.408 --> 35:12.081
She didn't use the "D" word.

35:12.143 --> 35:15.488
My eyes, I could see you two
back together within a couple months.

35:16.648 --> 35:17.991
That your honest read?

35:19.618 --> 35:21.097
That's my honest read, Marty.

35:45.443 --> 35:46.979
Look, I don't know

35:47.078 --> 35:49.581
how this guy I'm meeting tonight
feels about me.

35:49.648 --> 35:50.854
What does that mean?

35:51.016 --> 35:55.089
It means if you lose track of me tonight,
keep this fucker handy.

35:55.754 --> 35:58.132
And be listening
to Beaumont police channels.

35:58.189 --> 35:59.189
Yeah.

35:59.257 --> 36:00.998
- You got it?
- Yeah.

36:01.092 --> 36:02.799
- You got it.
- I got it.

36:02.861 --> 36:04.431
Are you gonna be all right?

36:43.301 --> 36:45.144
Crash here for Ginger.

37:15.900 --> 37:19.507
After Houston, I got to
a doc in Eagle Pass.

37:20.839 --> 37:22.785
Coyote got me across the border.

37:23.942 --> 37:27.515
Past two years I've been working security
for a group in San Miguel.

37:30.181 --> 37:32.627
Feds never ID'd me, so I figured,

37:32.717 --> 37:35.789
"Hell, two years pass, things chill down."

37:36.354 --> 37:39.028
It was cool for me to come back,
stick my head out.

37:39.624 --> 37:41.035
It'll be tough, man,

37:42.594 --> 37:44.596
thinking you been dead this whole time.

37:45.029 --> 37:47.031
Fuck, I look dead, motherfucker?

37:48.566 --> 37:50.477
I'm looking to get with you.

37:51.035 --> 37:52.480
You or Miles.

37:53.605 --> 37:55.710
Miles ain't gonna wanna see you, Crash.

37:56.074 --> 37:57.712
Oh, I think he might.

37:58.643 --> 37:59.917
Then I'd say,

38:00.545 --> 38:02.456
I don't think you want to see Miles.

38:02.947 --> 38:05.450
Man, I ain't here to start
a thing, all right.

38:06.251 --> 38:10.666
Boys I been running with in Mexico, there
could be a hell of a deal for both sides.

38:10.755 --> 38:12.325
Fucking money to be made.

38:12.423 --> 38:13.800
Real money.

38:15.226 --> 38:16.671
What kind of money?

38:23.468 --> 38:25.004
Goddamn, Rust.

38:26.004 --> 38:27.244
What the fuck?

38:57.101 --> 38:59.274
My boys are looking to trade' all right?

38:59.337 --> 39:00.782
Coke for meth.

39:09.280 --> 39:10.691
What you got there?

39:10.849 --> 39:12.351
This is something just for you.

39:12.450 --> 39:14.020
- Something just for me'?
- U h-huh.

39:15.653 --> 39:16.996
What'd you cut it with?

39:17.055 --> 39:18.125
You'll see.

39:18.523 --> 39:19.695
You dig it.

39:22.493 --> 39:24.734
After all I meant to you, huh?

39:35.340 --> 39:37.684
Now, who exactly are these guys?

39:43.815 --> 39:44.987
Uh, they...

39:46.317 --> 39:47.762
Ex-Mex army.

39:47.852 --> 39:50.264
They got a Colombian connection.

39:50.355 --> 39:53.029
They need meth for the maquiladoras.

39:54.492 --> 39:56.096
They could cook it themselves,

39:56.194 --> 39:58.174
but then the cartels would take notice,

39:58.229 --> 40:00.368
and that ain't what they're looking for.

40:00.498 --> 40:01.670
Hmm.

40:06.004 --> 40:07.108
Here.

40:07.939 --> 40:09.384
Taste that, homie.

40:18.516 --> 40:21.360
- That ain't no fuck around shit.
- Goddamn.

40:28.459 --> 40:29.699
Whom.!

40:30.361 --> 40:31.772
You keep it.

40:32.030 --> 40:35.477
I got bulldozers' worth of that shit
where I came from.

40:38.970 --> 40:40.244
The thing is,

40:41.873 --> 40:43.147
we got one cook.

40:44.042 --> 40:46.147
Does all our work exclusive, like.

40:47.045 --> 40:49.047
He's real specific about that.

40:49.380 --> 40:52.486
What's this worth to you, Crash?
Me selling Miles on this?

40:53.318 --> 40:55.389
I'll go you one better, brother.

40:57.255 --> 40:59.565
We don't take that shit to Miles at all.

41:00.258 --> 41:01.965
You and me work the supplier.

41:02.060 --> 41:04.472
The cut's whatever the
fuck we want it to be.

41:04.562 --> 41:06.132
Now, that's tricky shit, bro.

41:06.230 --> 41:07.971
And I don't know you like I used to.

41:08.066 --> 41:10.012
I don't know you like I used to either.

41:10.101 --> 41:11.136
That's why the fuck I'm here.

41:11.235 --> 41:13.237
Well, let me tell you why I came, Crash.

41:13.304 --> 41:14.647
I need something from you.

41:14.739 --> 41:15.739
Tonight.

41:15.773 --> 41:20.085
I had a four-man team for a big grab
and lost one to smokies.

41:20.144 --> 41:21.680
I came looking to replace him.

41:21.779 --> 41:23.190
If you're still a badass.

41:23.281 --> 41:25.591
I don't do A and R, man.
No fucking bank job.

41:25.650 --> 41:26.993
It ain't nothing like that.

41:27.085 --> 41:28.325
I need a good soldier.

41:28.419 --> 41:30.160
Now, you do this with us,

41:30.922 --> 41:33.198
we talk about putting you with my man.

41:33.424 --> 41:34.664
Look.

41:35.159 --> 41:37.366
I don't ride cowboy no more, Ginger.

41:37.462 --> 41:41.535
None of this small-time shit like this
thing you're talking about, all right?

41:42.300 --> 41:44.280
What, did you get neutered down south?

41:45.036 --> 41:47.038
I embrace the outlaw life.

41:48.539 --> 41:50.382
Now you dress the part, still.

41:52.310 --> 41:53.789
That's just an act?

41:54.612 --> 41:56.353
When in Rome, brother.

41:56.614 --> 41:59.117
But I do clean up real fucking pretty.

42:01.686 --> 42:03.529
Motherfucker, I need a gunslinger.

42:04.055 --> 42:06.797
Now, you ain't too timid,
get on this shit with me.

42:07.525 --> 42:10.005
Then we can talk about doing business.

42:14.165 --> 42:15.303
Where?

42:17.869 --> 42:18.973
My place.

42:22.240 --> 42:23.480
Down the bayou.

42:24.809 --> 42:26.220
All right, I got my truck.

42:26.577 --> 42:27.885
It'll be safe here.

42:33.151 --> 42:34.391
Members only.

42:34.485 --> 42:36.658
I'm just looking for a friend.

43:14.258 --> 43:15.703
Hey! What the fuck?

43:15.760 --> 43:17.364
Look, look, look. My buddy's in AA...

43:17.428 --> 43:18.566
But you ain't listening.

43:18.629 --> 43:19.801
And I'm his sponsor.

43:19.897 --> 43:21.774
I'm worried that he might
have started drinking again.

43:21.866 --> 43:25.609
You better worry we don't pull your
head off and shit down your neck!

43:25.703 --> 43:28.547
He's been 20 years sober!
Just give me one second!

43:35.413 --> 43:36.790
- What the hell?
- I'm leaving.

43:36.881 --> 43:40.886
A guy could just come in here and say,
"Looking for a fucking friend"!

43:44.422 --> 43:46.424
Get the fuck out of here!

43:47.291 --> 43:48.429
I'm leaving!

43:49.060 --> 43:50.061
Jesus Christ.

43:50.261 --> 43:51.569
Hey, motherfucker!

43:54.799 --> 43:56.142
That's good.

44:21.959 --> 44:23.336
Gotta piss, man!

44:23.427 --> 44:24.427
Fuck is that?

44:24.462 --> 44:26.499
That's Tigger the nigger.

44:26.597 --> 44:28.099
Name's Tiger Thomas.

44:28.933 --> 44:31.937
Dealer in them Heston Projects.
You know them?

44:32.003 --> 44:34.677
It's like them bungalowed,
flat-like joints, right?

44:34.772 --> 44:35.807
Yeah.

44:36.541 --> 44:38.282
They keep a stash house there.

44:38.342 --> 44:40.447
Fucking suck a dick!

44:40.845 --> 44:43.348
Hey, why don't you shut
the fuck up, nigger?

44:43.447 --> 44:44.482
Fuck you!

44:44.549 --> 44:48.622
So y'all gonna take
a stash house in coon country, huh?

44:48.786 --> 44:49.787
Four guys.

44:49.854 --> 44:52.960
How big's the projects, man?
Like square block-wise.

44:56.127 --> 44:57.970
Get the gear, Mitch.

45:01.632 --> 45:04.340
Wait till you see this.
You're gonna love it.

45:15.980 --> 45:17.482
You're going in as cops, huh?

45:18.816 --> 45:19.920
Yeah.

45:20.651 --> 45:22.858
You know where the stash house is?

45:23.387 --> 45:25.196
Tiger's gonna take us there.

45:25.990 --> 45:27.992
You got an exit plan?

45:28.426 --> 45:29.666
Hmm?

45:30.261 --> 45:31.501
Timetable?

45:32.263 --> 45:33.606
Real oops come, then what? Huh?

45:35.266 --> 45:37.678
And you say you're going in
in one fucking car?

45:37.735 --> 45:38.907
Uh-huh.

45:39.003 --> 45:40.380
As far as I remember, man,

45:42.039 --> 45:43.245
place is blocked in.

45:43.341 --> 45:45.116
Now there's one way in, one way out.

45:45.209 --> 45:47.689
It could be fucking Mogadishu, man.

45:48.412 --> 45:51.689
We hit trouble, you just gonna
fuck it in the ass.

45:53.884 --> 45:57.297
You scoop out the soft
brains inside the skull.

45:59.357 --> 46:01.098
So you have thought it out.

46:03.261 --> 46:04.262
My bad.

46:22.213 --> 46:26.457
I come through for you on this tonight,
I gotta know you're gonna hook me up.

46:26.617 --> 46:30.064
'Cause I got a real job
I was supposed to be doing.

46:30.888 --> 46:31.992
Hmm?

46:32.089 --> 46:35.229
You got my word.
You back me on this, I back you.

46:47.438 --> 46:49.111
Fuck it. Let's go.

46:49.573 --> 46:51.280
Up and at 'em, eggplant!

46:54.812 --> 46:56.985
Motherfuckers. Fuck you!

46:57.081 --> 46:59.618
- Come on!
- Fuck you! I'll kill you motherfuckers!

47:02.820 --> 47:04.595
Y'all are dead!

47:06.357 --> 47:10.430
Available cars, possible 503
at the Sears lot in the mall.

47:12.096 --> 47:14.337
40-6 reported on Holyhill Street.

47:15.766 --> 47:20.806
All available 459 at the Circle K,
corner of Lake and Lincoln.

47:25.142 --> 47:26.883
Air three, dispatch.

47:27.278 --> 47:28.985
Go ahead, air three.

47:29.513 --> 47:32.050
Over Zone 6. Heston Projects.

47:32.883 --> 47:35.625
Pretty quiet. Possible 507s.

47:36.387 --> 47:37.957
Everything's code four.

47:38.823 --> 47:40.666
Copy that. 10-4, air three.

47:44.862 --> 47:47.206
I mean
you got two ways to look at it, Tiger.

47:47.531 --> 47:49.533
You can die and lose your shit,

47:49.633 --> 47:51.306
or you could live

47:51.802 --> 47:53.873
